.TH start-container-plugin-url 1  "url " 
.SH NAME
start\-container\-plugin\-url \- Commands for the URL plugin
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-container plugin url\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands for the URL plugin
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
start\-container\-plugin\-url\-clear\-urls(1)
Remove URLs this plugin exported (JSON parameters on stdin)
.TP
start\-container\-plugin\-url\-export\-url(1)
Export a URL to a host (JSON parameters on stdin)
.TP
start\-container\-plugin\-url\-register(1)
Register this service as a URL plugin (JSON parameters on stdin)
